{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Follow the Standards and Do as You\u2019re Taught</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bow your head. Curl your tail. Smile when it hurts. You\u2019ll follow rules so twisted they gnaw at your mind. Every choice is a gamble, every success a nail in the coffin of your soul.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cats With Standards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story-driven hidden object descent into madness. Non-stress gameplay which still\u00a0claw through the sinister truth of a world that demands you to obey. The darker the rules, the darker the secrets and the more you\u2019ll wonder if you ever belonged at all.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hidden Object</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bones. Yes, bones. Find them to continue. They don\u2019t belong to the cats, but they obey anyway. A society so warped, even their appetites aren\u2019t their own. Each hidden fragment adds to the grotesque mosaic of your crumbling reality.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Psychological Horror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dystopian nightmare dripping in fur and fangs. Find yourself laughing when you're supposed to cry. The original soundtrack gnaws at your mind, dragging you deeper into a world where the laughter feels wrong, and silence is worse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A visual novel of fractured choices and splintered realities. Every decision shifts your fate, weaving a web of endings that tighten around you. Choose carefully\u2014rebellion might hurt, but obedience will destroy you completely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No AI Used in Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All parts of the game is hand-made by a solo game developer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Small game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cats With Standards is a short visual novel, with minimal gameplay. Take a cup of your favorite refreshment, sit back and relax while following the story. It takes approximately 1-2 hours to complete the game, depending on your playstyle.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Pandora","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3320020/7a253f22ad96902b7a0bacc32a926cf4272b609b.jpg"},{"name":"Immunity","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3320020/3b2f44e326160b7509558ab310ec96d85104ca0a.jpg"},{"name":"Embrace","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3320020/c9569f22fe7cf04c252b33bb143cad91728081bd.jpg"},{"name":"Madness","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3320020/863759abe3cf9342e55c2729e773564a0da1da72.jpg"},{"name":"Whispering Alley","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3320020/6256ccc65dd5f28d3a90614745e154a1f50bdeb7.jpg"},{"name":"Land of the Exiled","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3320020/25faef4955137602b3716aff8e68810c9ad81a11.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3320020?t=1761908552","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320020/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761908552","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320020/931d776c6fbd7f6fc1d26876cb6ab104a9952dca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761908552","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320020/931d776c6fbd7f6fc1d26876cb6ab104a9952dca/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761908552","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"F